---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Split from '../components/Split.astro'

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL
---

<BaseLayout title="Church Life | Pine Lake Covenant Church">
  <div class="canvas">
    <Split
      class="to-full"
      filename="716230305_18207937204338056_7473215551578781003_n.jpg"
      alt="Members talking and laughing together in the sanctuary"
      tone="sand"
      reverse
      eyebrow="Church Life"
    >
      <h1 class="display">Church Life</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Pine Lake is more than a Sunday gathering. This page is for people who are beginning to make Pine Lake home, and
        want to see what shared life looks like here.
      </p>
    </Split>

    <Split
      class="to-full"
      filename="474748731_1030392515795404_2521947271930024728_n.jpg"
      alt="People connecting together in community at Pine Lake"
      tone="paper"
      eyebrow="Through the week"
      heading="Life together"
    >
      <p>
        Most of what makes Pine Lake feel like home happens outside of Sunday — a smaller group that meets through the
        week, a shared meal, or the people who show up when a season turns hard.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Life Groups</strong> — small groups that meet through the week to build friendships, study Scripture, and
          support one another.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Shared meals &amp; gatherings</strong> — regular rhythms like Tuesdays Together and MomCo that make it easy
          to find your people.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </Split>

    <Split
      class="to-full"
      filename="481269178_1059869906180998_2732338907948607869_n.jpg"
      alt="The church gathered in matching shirts for the Global 6K for Water walk"
      tone="sand"
      reverse
      eyebrow="Serving others"
      heading="Serving others, here and far"
    >
      <p>
        Following Jesus pulls us outward. Serving is woven into life at Pine Lake — close to home around Sammamish and
        Issaquah, and through long-term partners around the world.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Pine Lake Academy</strong> (Kodera, Kenya) — a preschool-through-8th-grade school founded in partnership
          with Pine Lake and funded, in part, by our donations over the last twenty years.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong
            ><a href="https://giving.covchurch.org/personnel-detail/melinda-anderson" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
              >Melinda Anderson</a
            ></strong
          > (Guatemala) — a Covenant partner working in education and community care, walking with people as they rebuild
          their lives.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong
            ><a href="https://giving.covchurch.org/personnel-detail/EvensandKarinaPaul" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
              >Evens &amp; Karina Paul</a
            ></strong
          > (Haiti) — Covenant partners in rural Haiti who run a school of more than 350 students, pastor churches they’ve
          planted, and help families build sustainable livelihoods.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <a href={`${base}for-our-neighbors/serve-locally/`}>See how we serve our local community →</a>
      </p>
    </Split>

    <Split
      class="to-full"
      filename="716722551_18207937243338056_4731496310256514273_n.jpg"
      alt="Carrying groceries for the Issaquah & Sammamish food project"
      tone="paper"
      eyebrow="Generosity"
      heading="Practicing generosity"
    >
      <p>
        Giving is one way we respond to God’s generosity toward us. It supports the mission and shared life of Pine
        Lake, and helps us care for our community, both locally and globally.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="https://plcc.churchcenter.com/giving">Learn more about giving at Pine Lake →</a>
      </p>
    </Split>

    <Split
      class="to-full"
      filename="476750093_18157384759338056_1921287384410502360_n.jpg"
      alt="A moment of care and prayer in community"
      tone="sand"
      reverse
      eyebrow="You’re not alone"
      heading="Care & support"
    >
      <p>
        When life is difficult, the church is here to offer prayer, care, and practical support. You don’t have to walk
        alone.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href={`${base}for-our-neighbors/care-support/`}>See how we care for one another →</a>
      </p>
    </Split>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Getting started</h2>
      <p class="measure">
        If you are exploring Pine Lake for the first time,
        <a href={`${base}next-steps/`}>Next Steps</a> is usually the best place to begin.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
